    "description": "<p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p><i>In <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Zero-Gravity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zero-Gravity\">Zero-Gravity</a>, some creatures have a hard time maintaining their internal equilibrium.</i> </p><h2><span id=\"Space_Sickness_Statistics_.28CL_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Space_Sickness_Statistics_(CL_1)\">Space Sickness Statistics (CL 1)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Natural </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A creature begins its turn in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Zero-Gravity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zero-Gravity\">Zero-Gravity</a>. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +0 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence: </b>Once, after 8 hours within <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Zero-Gravity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zero-Gravity\">Zero-Gravity</a>. </p><p><b>Suggested&nbsp;Skills:</b>&nbsp;The following are suggested&nbsp;Skills&nbsp;for this Hazard: </p><ul>\n <li><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a>&nbsp;(DC 20):</b> The character removes the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a>.</li>\n</ul><p><b>Special:</b> The <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a> from Space Sickness is removed from a creature after 8 hours of rest. </p>",
